  "code" : "public int findMin(int[] nums) {\n    int low = 0, high = nums.length - 1, ans = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (nums[low] <= nums[mid]) {\n            ans = Math.min(ans, nums[low]);\n            low = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            ans = Math.min(ans, nums[mid]);\n            high = mid - 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
